        "block_name": "chapter01/dialogue.rpy::chapter01_start"
      },
      {
        "id": "chapter01/dialogue.rpy:chapter01_start:2:ade3eb87",
        "text": "Almost. {i}Almost{/i} is the operative word, CharacterA.",
